WEBVTT

00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:31.556
and video calls.

00:02:31.596 --> 00:02:33.116
Hmm.

00:02:33.116 --> 00:02:36.596
Now, I've been lucky to work remotely
for a lot of my career,

00:02:36.636 --> 00:02:40.036
and it is amazing
for so many different reasons.

00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:42.436
Without all of the technology
we have today,

00:02:42.436 --> 00:02:44.716
remote work would be impossible.

00:02:44.756 --> 00:02:48.196
But our overreliance on video calls

00:02:48.196 --> 00:02:50.916
is hurting our ability
to be creative as a team.

00:02:51.756 --> 00:02:53.036
And this is a big problem

00:02:53.076 --> 00:02:56.876
because creativity
isn't just for artists and musicians.

00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:59.756
It's what drives innovation
in our workplaces.

00:02:59.796 --> 00:03:03.996
And without it, we can't solve
the many problems we face as humanity.